{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1262.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"3563ca9df84d2a151dc4550a717b021a6e90deb3d57d55b1dcb9ba14cb86dba0","ja":"こっちはウェディングガーデンか……。\nうわ～っ、めっちゃ広いやん♪","zh":"这边是婚礼花园啊……\n哇～好大啊♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1262.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"b6c664e06b4d8745d1022fdbc555d54127764ebf0e0588254f63ee82633f8e5d","ja":"ここなら、ブーケを思いっきり投げられそうだよね♪","zh":"在这里的话，感觉就能痛痛快快地把花束扔出去了呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1262.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"85833e0e0b4657c89da6b0bfc73be2f1a9545c95ba6c66959656e1ff7e281c7d","ja":"そうかもしれへんけど……海美が全力で投げたら、\n誰もキャッチできへんかもしらんで？","zh":"话是这么说啦……不过要是海美全力投球的话，\n可能谁也接不住哦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1262.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f18937685ee6fcd6d7ef6e4773553c2549fec1eec869966ade517b7e7cdc8091","ja":"そっか～。それじゃあ、\nやさしく投げた方がいいのかなっ？","zh":"这样啊～。那是不是\n轻轻投比较好呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1262.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"36f2ced3a38a0c9aed6e0d1acfc9f191cd340647d6019d8ad603d7e09f0c0b9a","ja":"……あっ、向こうの方にも何かあるよ！\nみんなで行ってみよ～♪","zh":"……啊，那边好像也有什么东西！\n大家一起过去看看吧～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1262.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ba1e3d448128fed0ebe77bb2f926f14023fe98a6fbe0b4537736585855573242","ja":"競争なの？\nそれなら負けないさー！","zh":"要竞争吗？\n那我可不会输的哦——！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1262.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"a6116bb80748c8bc6eb26256056f479e43af69b86f97d068748cf25816a9e74d","ja":"あっと言う間に行ってしまいました……。","zh":"转眼间就走掉了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1262.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"e8b226b4d733ffcbcc2d7db986645c44da37cf9b85735e0a6fe0737b28e4c990","ja":"にぎやかでいいですな～。海美ちゃんや響さんの\n結婚式も、にぎやかな感じになるのでしょうか～。","zh":"热热闹闹的挺好呢～。海美和响小姐的\n婚礼，也会是这种热闹的感觉吗～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1262.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"52ae06079fa23a9fd41dd13f3a247fc8d551fbaa067c2e4f8cdd80583ab4e753","ja":"結婚式場にいると、\nみんなの結婚式を想像してしまいますね。","zh":"身在婚礼现场，\n就会忍不住想象起大家的婚礼呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1262.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"8c89315f3c591b517e02f06e72d646ff11c6be7bc227fb08ef3ca2ae4d63ca0f","ja":"……私の時は、どんな感じになるのかな？","zh":"……轮到我的时候，会是什么样子的呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1262.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"59c165f90b5930582f8dad4900c3abc3144e44964ea20a3ec9d0eadffe298a3f","ja":"そうして撮影が進み、\nあとは歌収録を残すだけになって……","zh":"拍摄就这样顺利进行着，\n之后就只剩下歌曲录制了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1262.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"ce4debb2d6c3adb307a8d35c555566c6f18ea1b0cc9dbd56d3987ec62f54cdfb","ja":"今更やけど……私らはしゃいでただけで、\nこれってホンマに宣伝になるんかな？","zh":"事到如今才说这个也是……我们光顾着瞎闹了，\n这样真的能起到宣传作用吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1262.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"b3885c083594618cc7e2f7321997ac194f08dcac5f39d7ab7165a63477629412","ja":"はい。ただ式場を満喫してただけのような気もします。\n……でもとても楽しかったぞ。","zh":"是的。感觉自己好像只是在尽情享受婚礼现场而已。\n……不过玩得非常开心哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1262.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"8180b4dc8b7fae698cc7d7c0b8e54ec84d8fb2f874c6246714bb2ee206b6491d","ja":"大丈夫ですよ～。\nきっと、楽しい雰囲気は伝わりますから～♪","zh":"没关系的～。\n开心的气氛一定能传达给大家的～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1262.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"125113946a99102759ab297e76ff566e3ab529b5180ad43f50d43f87875c1bb6","ja":"ムービーを見てくれた人、みんながここで\n結婚式したいって、思ってくれるはずだよね！","zh":"看了这段影片的人，肯定都会想在这里\n办婚礼的对吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1262.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"ef9c53bb42b612b7027557d1f7631b9a7015e60fdce18fad41100c53edc62bef","ja":"自分もそんな気持ちになれたぞ♪\nそれじゃあ、このハッピーな気持ちのままで……。","zh":"我也变得有这种感觉了呢♪\n那么，就趁着这份幸福的心情……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1262.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"c243db3a49d489a792784c8d5383ca22036db1b72e6ef752f8ffa467b30bbbaa","ja":"ムービーのラストを飾る自分達の歌も、\n思いっきりみんなに届けるさー！","zh":"负责为影片收尾的我们的歌，\n也要全力传达给大家哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
